package Libraries.Language.Compile.Test

use Libraries.Testing.Tester
use Formats.Tests.NumberFormatterTest
use Formats.Tests.JavaScriptObjectNotationTemplateTest

/*
Tests Libraries.Data.Formats.NumberFormatter and JavaScriptObjectNotationTemplate.
Like ScienceTester, it runs Libraries.Testing.Test classes (CaseTest, in
Quorum/SourceCode/Tests/Formats) in-process and adds them to the suite's
Tester. A failed test also prints the message of each failed expectation.
*/
class DataFormatsTester
    Tester tester = undefined

    action GetName returns text
        return "Data Formats Tests"
    end

    action SetTester(Tester tester)
        me:tester = tester
    end

    action Test
        NumberFormatterTest numberFormatterTest
        numberFormatterTest:RunWith(tester)

        JavaScriptObjectNotationTemplateTest javaScriptObjectNotationTemplateTest
        javaScriptObjectNotationTemplateTest:RunWith(tester)
    end
end
